citly excludes sensitive fields\",\n        \"Update all user-returning endpoints to use response DTOs\",\n        \"Add tests to verify password is never returned\"\n      ],\n      \"estimatedEffort\": \"45 minutes\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"priority\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"category\": \"TESTING\",\n      \"title\": \"Add comprehensive test coverage for authentication\",\n      \"description\": \"No tests found for the new authentication feature. This is critical for security-sensitive code.\",\n      \"actionItems\": [\n        \"Create auth.service.spec.ts with unit tests for login, register, validateUser\",\n        \"Create auth.controller.spec.ts for endpoint testing\",\n        \"Test edge cases: invalid credentials, duplicate users, malformed input\",\n        \"Add integration tests for full authentication flow\",\n        \"Achieve minimum 80% code coverage for auth module\",\n        \"Add tests for JWT token validation and expiration\"\n      ],\n      \"estimatedEffort\": \"3 hours\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"priority\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"category\": \"VALIDATION\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement input validation with DTOs\",\n      \"description\": \"Authentication endpoints lack proper input validation, allowing malformed data to reach business logic.\",\n      \"actionItems\": [\n        \"Create RegisterDto with class-validator decorators\",\n        \"Create LoginDto with email and password validation\",\n        \"Add @IsEmail(), @MinLength(), @MaxLength() decorators\",\n        \"Enable global validation pipe in main.ts\",\n        \"Add custom validators for password strength\",\n        \"Test validation with invalid inputs\"\n      ],\n      \"estimatedEffort\": \"1 hour\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"priority\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"category\": \"ERROR_HANDLING\",\n      \"title\": \"Improve error handling and HTTP status codes\",\n      \"description\": \"Current implementation uses generic error handling that doesn't provide clear feedback to clients.\",\n      \"actionItems\": [\n        \"Wrap database operations in try-catch blocks\",\n        \"Throw appropriate HTTP exceptions (ConflictException, UnauthorizedException)\",\n        \"Create custom exception filters for consistent error responses\",\n        \"Add error logging with proper context\",\n        \"Document error responses in API documentation\"\n      ],\n      \"estimatedEffort\": \"1.5 hours\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"priority\": \"LOW\",\n      \"category\": \"DOCUMENTATION\",\n      \"title\": \"Add API documentation with Swagger\",\n      \"description\": \"New authentication endpoints lack API documentation making it difficult for frontend developers to integrate.\",\n      \"actionItems\": [\n        \"Add @ApiTags('auth') to auth controller\",\n        \"Add @ApiOperation() decorators to each endpoint\",\n        \"Add @ApiResponse() for success and error cases\",\n        \"Document request/response schemas with @ApiProperty()\",\n        \"Add example payloads for better clarity\"\n      ],\n      \"estimatedEffort\": \"45 minutes\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"priority\": \"LOW\",\n      \"category\": \"PERFORMANCE\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement refresh token mechanism\",\n      \"description\": \"Current implementation uses long-lived access tokens (24h) which increases security risk if tokens are compromised.\",\n      \"actionItems\": [\n        \"Create refresh token table in database\",\n        \"Reduce access token lifetime to 15 minutes\",\n        \"Implement refresh token endpoint\",\n        \"Add refresh token rotation\",\n        \"Add logout endpoint to invalidate refresh tokens\",\n        \"Update frontend to handle token refresh\"\n      ],\n      \"estimatedEffort\": \"2 hours\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"reviewedAt\": \"2024-01-15T15:45:00Z\",\n    \"reviewedBy\": \"Claude Code Review System\",\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n    \"tools\": [\n      \"code-quality-analyzer\",\n      \"test-coverage-analyzer\", \n      \"refactoring-suggester\"\n    ],\n    \"configUsed\": {\n      \"securityChecks\": true,\n      \"performanceAnalysis\": true,\n      \"testCoverageThreshold\": 80,\n      \"complexityThreshold\": 10\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Summary\n\nThis Pull Request introduces a JWT-based authentication system for the todo app. While the implementation demonstrates good understanding of NestJS patterns and uses appropriate libraries (bcrypt, passport, JWT), there are **3 critical security issues** that must be addressed before merging:\n\n1. **Hardcoded JWT secret** - Must be moved to environment variables\n2. **No rate limiting** - Vulnerable to brute force attacks  \n3. **Password exposure risk** - User objects with passwords could be leaked in responses\n\nAdditionally, the PR lacks test coverage entirely, which is concerning for security-critical authentication code. I recommend addressing the HIGH priority security issues first, then adding comprehensive tests before this can be safely merged.\n\n**Overall Assessment: NEEDS_WORK** - Approximately 6-8 hours of additional development required to meet production-ready standards."